From b557479c4d3c58760fd81d5d35c870f39ab14e9b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Moebius <agent@moebius>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 20:42:45 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Fold the int8 card reading into serve-patch 0210

The PR's serving patch 0211 could not stand alone: its hunks in
libr4d, libhalo and docs/OPS.md replace lines that 0210 first writes
(the gemm_dtype gate, the OPS paragraph), so it applied only after
0210. Every serving patch must apply on the pinned radiance by itself
(CONTRIBUTING.md, docs/UPSTREAM.md). Fold 0211's card rows into 0210
and drop 0211; the serving set produces the identical tree in both
application orders (checked against the PR's build state). Budget in
docs/UPSTREAM.md rises to 440 (+383/-37) with the reason recorded;
docs/ADAPTER.md, docs/PLAN.md and the test comments follow the fold.
